OL,3,ACalifornia warned of potential
OL,4,AThanksgiving flooding as storms
OL,5,Athreaten US coasts
OL,6,
OL,7,FCoastal areas of California are bracing
OL,8,Ffor potential flooding as king tides
OL,9,Fpeak in the state during the US
OL,10,FThanksgiving holiday.
OL,12,FWater levels across the US state's vast
OL,13,Fcoastline could reach over 8ft (2.4
OL,14,Fmetres) in some areas on Wednesday and
OL,15,FThursday, according to the National
OL,16,FWeather Service (NWS) - breaking
OL,17,Frecords set just last month.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
