OL,3,ACalifornia warned of potential
OL,4,AThanksgiving flooding as storms
OL,5,Athreaten US coasts
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe NWS has warned parts of California
OL,8,Fcould face major coastal flooding,
OL,9,Fwhich is likely to be significant in
OL,10,Flow-lying areas. There have already
OL,11,Fbeen some reports of flooding.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, storms are also forecast for
OL,14,Fthe Pacific Northwest, including the
OL,15,FCanadian province of British Columbia,
OL,16,Fand eastern parts of the US.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
